"","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"610011356","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["我向水里的那东西射空了所有子弹，也不知道它究竟是什么。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"19":{"step":[[19,20,""]],"type":1,"name":["记录者","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"610011698","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["而将航道带回正轨的是那帮神秘学家。她准确地说出了当前的经纬度，甚至没有启动备用舱里的六分仪。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"20":{"step":[[20,21,""]],"type":1,"name":["记录者","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"610011357","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["我不知道她是怎么做到的……也许她眼里的世界真的和我眼里的不一样。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"21":{"step":[[21,22,""]],"type":1,"name":["记录者","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"610011358","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["当我要踏上某块木板时，她突然拽了我一把。我以为这是一个不合时宜的恶作剧……","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"22":{"step":[[22,23,""]],"type":1,"name":["记录者","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"610011359","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["下一秒，那块木板就碎了。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"23":{"step":[[23,24,""]],"type":1,"name":["记录者","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"610011360","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["我惊讶于她如何得知。她稀松平常地告诉我：","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"24":{"step":[[24,25,""]],"type":1,"name":["“她”","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"610011236","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["“因为它在菱形的形变处。”","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"25":{"step":[[25,26,""]],"type":1,"name":["记录者","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"610011361","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["我十分不解，“请问，哪里有菱形？”于是她笑了。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"26":{"step":[[26,27,""]],"type":1,"name":["“她”","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"610011237","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["“您这样是什么都看不到的，得闭上眼睛，用心去聆听那至高存在的启示，捕捉那灵感的一瞬闪光才行！”","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"27":{"step":[[27,28,""]],"type":1,"name":["记录者","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"610011362","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["当然，我什么也看不到，也不明白何为灵感的一闪。也许这和发疯一样，是神秘学家的特权。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"28":{"step":[[28,165,""]],"type":1,"name":["记录者","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"610011363","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["——一个人使用的方式是完全错误的，却离奇地抵达了正确的结论。这样的事情有概率发生吗？","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"167":{"step":[[167,168,""]],"type":0,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"30":{"step":[[30,31,""]],"type":1,"name":["记录者","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"610011364","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["……无论如何，她救了我一命。但这很难消除我们之间既有的隔阂。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"31":{"step":[[31,32,""]],"type":1,"name":["记录者","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"610011365","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["她拒绝了与基金会的合作，我也放弃了说服他们的尝试。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"32":{"step":[[32,33,""]],"type":1,"name":["记录者","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"610011366","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["接触他们并非我此行的任务。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"33":{"step":[[33,34,""]],"type":1,"name":["记录者","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"610011699","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["何况，我们需要的是能建设“暴雨”观测体系的人才，而不是让场面更加混乱的神棍。","","","",""